  "releaseNotes": "v0.1\n\t\t\t\t创世\n\t\t\t\t[2024-09-10] v0.18.4-preview1 升级缓存基础库\n\t\t\t\t[2024-10-16] v0.18.6-preview1 添加 Service 对 PagedList 对象快速 Mapping 到 DTO 对象的方法\n\t\t\t\t[2024-11-15] v0.19.0-preview1 使用新版本 AutoGen，升级 AgentsManager；解决 AgentsManager 中状态获取的异常\n\t\t\t\t[2024-11-21] v0.20.2-preview1 更新 CO2NET 及缓存基础库\n\t\t\t\t[2024-11-28] v0.20.3-preview1 update CO2NET, use new SenparcSetting with UseLowerCaseApiName property\n\t\t\t\t[2025-01-25] v0.20.7-preview1 Update Agents functions, support for function calling\n\t\t\t\t[2025-04-29] v0.20.9-preview1 Update CO2NET and AIKernel\n\t\t\t\t[2025-11-01] update basic libraries, including Senparc.AI\n\t\t\t\t[2026-07-17] v0.21.2-preview2 同步上游项目版本并适配统一本地化能力\n\t\t\t\t1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.25.0-preview2\n\t\t\t\t[2026-07-29] v0.21.3-preview3 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.26.0-preview3\n\t\t\t\t[2026-07-31] v0.22.0-preview4 扩展分页组件的多语言显示\n\t\t\t\t1、将上下移动作、分页范围、总数及翻页文案接入 NcfCoreResource\n\t\t\t\t2、保留现有分页 HTML 结构与默认中文回退\n\t\t\t\t[2026-08-04] v0.22.1-preview5 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.28.0-preview5\n\t\t\t\t[2026-08-08] v0.22.2-preview6 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.28.1-preview6\n\t\t\t\t[2026-08-13] v0.22.3-preview7 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.28.2-preview7\n\t\t\t\t[2026-08-15] v0.22.4-preview8 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.29.0-preview8\n\t\t\t\t[2026-08-29] v0.22.5-preview9 Dependency updates from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.30.0-preview9\n\t\t\t\t1、Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.30.0-preview9\n\t\t\t\t[2026-11-03] v0.22.6-preview10 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.Core to 0.30.3-preview9",
